==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|automne}}, {{m|fro|autompne}}, probably later borrowed from {{bor|fr|la|autumnus}}. The rural and popular term for autumn was {{m|fr|[[après]] [[août]]||after August}}.

